--- !u!114 &276989074
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 276989071}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ae6d0f49fbfcabe459cb02d659fcf0de, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TD_Game.DialogueNPC
  npcName: Cuauhtli, ghost of an eagle warrior
  id: cuauhtli
  firstTalk:
  - Halt, living one. I fell at the war of flowers, and I still guard this road out
    of habit.
  - Listen well. When an enemy glows red, wait... and press {Dodge} at the very last
    moment. Too soon and your guard locks.
  - 'In your turn, strike again when the blow lands ({Attack}): a critical hit, and
    your Tonalli grows.'
  - 'The servants of the gods hunt in packs now. Kill the witch first: she heals
    the others and curses you.'
  - And if you can, fall on them from a jump. A warrior who strikes first often strikes
    last.
  laterTalk:
  - Witches first. Dodge late. Jump on them when they do not see you. Go.
  body: {fileID: 1703136104}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  playerPortrait: {fileID: 1739314709, guid: 1622c75d16ce15649ae8d1e06ce707f8, type: 3}
  sign: {fileID: 1526308577}
  newSign: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 00d8b4e619285ad438ba5699ac7ae674, type: 3}
  talkedSign: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 27e2d5cfaf6daa146a0750d167006ea9, type: 3}
  idleBob: 1
