--- !u!114 &1183624525
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1183624522}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ae6d0f49fbfcabe459cb02d659fcf0de, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TD_Game.DialogueNPC
  npcName: Itzel, the herb girl
  id: itzel
  firstTalk:
  - Oh! You are not a ghost... You have colour in your cheeks.
  - "I gather cempas\xFAchil for the dead. Their smell shows the souls the way home."
  - But I do not go west any more. Past the dead trees there is a crooked house with
    four purple lights.
  - At night a man screams in there. My grandmother says the Cihuateteo keep him...
    the women of the west.
  - '> Four lights in the west. I will remember.'
  laterTalk:
  - Go to the far west of the valley, behind the dead trees. Follow the purple light...
    if you dare.
  body: {fileID: 256853872}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  playerPortrait: {fileID: 1739314709, guid: 1622c75d16ce15649ae8d1e06ce707f8, type: 3}
  sign: {fileID: 1222566767}
  newSign: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 00d8b4e619285ad438ba5699ac7ae674, type: 3}
  talkedSign: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 27e2d5cfaf6daa146a0750d167006ea9, type: 3}
  idleBob: 1
