--- !u!114 &1461235951
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1461235948}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ae6d0f49fbfcabe459cb02d659fcf0de, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TD_Game.DialogueNPC
  npcName: Atl, the fisherman
  id: atl
  firstTalk:
  - Nothing bites in this lake. Nothing alive, anyway.
  - "This water comes from the Apanohuaya, the river every soul must cross to reach
    Mictl\xE1n."
  - "The dead cross it on the back of a dog. A xoloitzcuintle. That is why the statue
    of X\xF3lotl stands here: the god-dog keeps the crossing."
  - Be kind to the dogs you meet. One of them may carry you one day.
  laterTalk:
  - A dog by the river of the forest watches the stones in the water. Strange animal.
  body: {fileID: 1804512408}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  playerPortrait: {fileID: 1739314709, guid: 1622c75d16ce15649ae8d1e06ce707f8, type: 3}
  sign: {fileID: 1764018472}
  newSign: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 00d8b4e619285ad438ba5699ac7ae674, type: 3}
  talkedSign: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 27e2d5cfaf6daa146a0750d167006ea9, type: 3}
  idleBob: 1
