--- !u!114 &2013094553
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2013094550}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ae6d0f49fbfcabe459cb02d659fcf0de, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TD_Game.DialogueNPC
  npcName: Tecolotl, the owl priest
  id: tecolotl
  firstTalk:
  - The owl sees in the dark, warrior. So do I.
  - "This is the Pyramid of the Feathered Serpent. Quetzalc\xF3atl came down here
    to steal the bones of the dead and give life to people."
  - Climb the stairs. On the summit, his shrine still speaks to those who read its
    glyphs... and the faithful leave offerings there.
  - "But Quetzalc\xF3atl himself waits in the House of the Wind, far to the east.
    Corrupted, they say. Hungry."
  laterTalk:
  - Read the glyphs on the summit, warrior. The stairs are in the middle of the south
    face.
  body: {fileID: 1904673198}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  playerPortrait: {fileID: 1739314709, guid: 1622c75d16ce15649ae8d1e06ce707f8, type: 3}
  sign: {fileID: 751657829}
  newSign: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 00d8b4e619285ad438ba5699ac7ae674, type: 3}
  talkedSign: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 27e2d5cfaf6daa146a0750d167006ea9, type: 3}
  idleBob: 1
